Stock v2606 interFoam and interIsoFoam with one change: PIMPLE switch ddtCorr
(default yes, bitwise identical to the stock solvers). With no, the predicted
face flux is phiHbyA = flux(HbyA), without interpolate(rho*rAU)*ddtCorr(U,phi,Uf),
as in applications/interIsoGoam/pEqn.H. interIsoFoamDdtCorr takes its own
pEqn.H (local directory first), other interFoam headers from FOAM_SOLVERS.
